    {
      "id": "claim_66405835693b4dbfba60672659b6bce4",
      "statement": "MCP has evolved across multiple protocol eras (e.g., 2025-11-25 vs 2026-07-28); modern versions support InputRequiredResult for mid-call elicitation via interrupt, legacy versions use older handshakes. MCPAdapter detects server version and selects appropriate interaction pattern; servers from different eras can coexist when separate adapters are used.",
