    {
      "id": "claim_50e9611bbe5b43b682c0f4c456c7677c",
      "statement": "list_tools() accepts cache_mode parameter controlling interaction with client-side response cache: 'use' (default, serves cached results within TTL), 'refresh' (forces server fetch and cache repopulation), 'bypass' (skips cache entirely). Cache is configured on the client itself; this parameter only selects how discovery reads it.",
