    {
      "id": "claim_4ceeff94908d4749b7488925cae796fa",
      "statement": "FastMCP clients are reentrant: tool coroutines can open the underlying client themselves whether or not a connection is already held elsewhere, enabling concurrent tool calls and simplifying connection lifecycle management.",
